
# File System Representation and Search Using BFS and DFS

## Project Description
This project represents a file system using a graph data structure and performs searching using Breadth First Search (BFS) and Depth First Search (DFS).

## Technologies Used
- C Programming
- Graph Data Structure
- Adjacency Matrix

## Algorithms Used
1. Breadth First Search (BFS)
2. Depth First Search (DFS)

## Features
- Represents folders as graph nodes.
- Uses an adjacency matrix to represent connections.
- Performs BFS traversal.
- Performs DFS traversal.
- Searches for a specified folder.

## How to Run
Compile and execute the main.c file using a C compiler.

